    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 哈，哈......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 罗德岛的医疗技术......是比我们的强......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "罗德岛的医疗技术......是比我们的强......"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 向各个感染者聚落派遣医护人员也在我们的计划之内，但是战乱地区的话，让普通医疗干员前去，太危险了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "向各个感染者聚落派遣医护人员也在我们的计划之内，但是战乱地区的话，让普通医疗干员前去，太危险了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 没事，已经......可以了。这样包扎就好了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "没事，已经......可以了。这样包扎就好了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 敌人撤退了。战场变大了。我没法再用那个法术，找不到他们。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "敌人撤退了。战场变大了。我没法再用那个法术，找不到他们。"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_058\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 那就靠我们的魔族佬吧，他们也很擅长。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "那就靠我们的魔族佬吧，他们也很擅长。"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 感谢你，罗德岛的战士。没有你的骁勇作战，我们的人员伤亡是不可避免的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "感谢你，罗德岛的战士。没有你的骁勇作战，我们的人员伤亡是不可避免的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 我刚才听到了，罗德岛的领袖。卡特斯人，你要独自前往指挥塔？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "我刚才听到了，罗德岛的领袖。卡特斯人，你要独自前往指挥塔？"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] ......是，也不是。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "......是，也不是。"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 解释一下。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "解释一下。"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 面对塔露拉的时候，可能只会有我一个。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "面对塔露拉的时候，可能只会有我一个。"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 也许，会有一位来自龙门的战士帮助我......但我假定只有我一个。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "也许，会有一位来自龙门的战士帮助我......但我假定只有我一个。"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 你一个人怎么杀死她？你不是大尉。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "你一个人怎么杀死她？你不是大尉。"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 但是，各位也不是。我们人越多，战斗起来就越束手束脚，何况塔露拉比爱国者先生更擅长短时间内压制战场的法术。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "但是，各位也不是。我们人越多，战斗起来就越束手束脚，何况塔露拉比爱国者先生更擅长短时间内压制战场的法术。"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 我要带一支小队进去，只是因为指挥塔内必定也还有其他敌人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我要带一支小队进去，只是因为指挥塔内必定也还有其他敌人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 够吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "够吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 我相信我的小队成员。他们都是最可靠也最擅长应对各种状况的战士。如果有我们没法处理的情况，我们会征求你们的帮助。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我相信我的小队成员。他们都是最可靠也最擅长应对各种状况的战士。如果有我们没法处理的情况，我们会征求你们的帮助。"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 你想将我们排除在决战之外？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "你想将我们排除在决战之外？"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 不，我不想主导这次战斗，只不过，先生，游击队有只有你们才能处理的战场。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "不，我不想主导这次战斗，只不过，先生，游击队有只有你们才能处理的战场。"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 你想让我们阻止其他人进入指挥塔。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "你想让我们阻止其他人进入指挥塔。"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 没错。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "没错。"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] ......阿米娅，你不想让我去？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "......阿米娅，你不想让我去？"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 在指挥塔外的战场上你会更安全。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "在指挥塔外的战场上你会更安全。"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 你不想让我和你一起战斗吗？我们两个人对抗塔露拉......！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "你不想让我和你一起战斗吗？我们两个人对抗塔露拉......！"
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 迷迭香，塔露拉的法术饱含能量，你也许很擅长处理各种物理上的伤害方式，但是，火焰的话......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "迷迭香，塔露拉的法术饱含能量，你也许很擅长处理各种物理上的伤害方式，但是，火焰的话......"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 可我......可她......她杀了Ace，杀了我那么多的亲人！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "可我......可她......她杀了Ace，杀了我那么多的亲人！"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 我为什么不能去？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "我为什么不能去？"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 我不擅长......我该怎么办？我能怎么办？我以前也有很多事情不擅长的！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "我不擅长......我该怎么办？我能怎么办？我以前也有很多事情不擅长的！"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 你恨塔露拉。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "你恨塔露拉。"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 不然呢，不然呢！我难道不能恨她吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "不然呢，不然呢！我难道不能恨她吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 迷迭香......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "迷迭香......"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 你问的这些我也没有答案。我不能说你不能恨一个你没见过的人......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "你问的这些我也没有答案。我不能说你不能恨一个你没见过的人......"
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 只是，迷迭香......分别之前，我有一个命令。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "只是，迷迭香......分别之前，我有一个命令。"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 命令？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "命令？"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 是。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "是。"
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 命令一定要遵守......凯尔希说过，精英干员要做到。我......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "命令一定要遵守......凯尔希说过，精英干员要做到。我......"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 嗯。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "嗯。"
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] ——Logos在我们临走前也对我说过，爱国者一生很少把别人称作强敌......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "——Logos在我们临走前也对我说过，爱国者一生很少把别人称作强敌......"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 以至于他喜欢用符号、特征和装备称呼别人，反而不太用姓名和种族来代指。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "以至于他喜欢用符号、特征和装备称呼别人，反而不太用姓名和种族来代指。"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 但是他在刚才，他用菲林来叫你。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "但是他在刚才，他用菲林来叫你。"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 也许他认可你了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "也许他认可你了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 他也这么叫你，他叫你卡特斯。认可什么？认可我这副让人害怕的样子吗？我不想被这么看待。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "他也这么叫你，他叫你卡特斯。认可什么？认可我这副让人害怕的样子吗？我不想被这么看待。"
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] ......但是，如果说许多人把我们当作怪物，那爱国者先生已经被当作怪物很多很多年了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "......但是，如果说许多人把我们当作怪物，那爱国者先生已经被当作怪物很多很多年了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 我们的身体里都藏着可怕的法术，没错。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我们的身体里都藏着可怕的法术，没错。"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 但他当我们是人。当我们是......人类。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "但他当我们是人。当我们是......人类。"
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 不是同类吗？都是些......可怕的，一直会被人讨厌的东西。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "不是同类吗？都是些......可怕的，一直会被人讨厌的东西。"
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 不。你看看这些游击队战士，这些跟随过其他整合运动领袖的战士，我们的战士......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "不。你看看这些游击队战士，这些跟随过其他整合运动领袖的战士，我们的战士......"
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 好的作为会赢得别人尊敬。坏的行为会被别人嫌恶讨厌。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "好的作为会赢得别人尊敬。坏的行为会被别人嫌恶讨厌。"
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 我们的所作所为才是别人判断我们的途径。就像队员们拥护你，就像盾卫拥护爱国者，就像我们愿意信任凯尔希医生。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我们的所作所为才是别人判断我们的途径。就像队员们拥护你，就像盾卫拥护爱国者，就像我们愿意信任凯尔希医生。"
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 迷迭香，我的命令是，你要活下去，也要保证大家能够尽可能地活下去。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "迷迭香，我的命令是，你要活下去，也要保证大家能够尽可能地活下去。"
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 为此，哪怕我会死去，你也不能来。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "为此，哪怕我会死去，你也不能来。"
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 阿米娅！可你是......我的朋友，我怎么能让......让你一个人！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "阿米娅！可你是......我的朋友，我怎么能让......让你一个人！"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 不！迷迭香。我保证。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "不！迷迭香。我保证。"
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 我保证我也会活着回来。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我保证我也会活着回来。"
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 所以，不管有人说了什么，不管有人说我遭遇了什么，我们都要各自做主，先完成我们自己的目标。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "所以，不管有人说了什么，不管有人说我遭遇了什么，我们都要各自做主，先完成我们自己的目标。"
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 我们都要活下去。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我们都要活下去。"
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 这个命令，也给在场的所有人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "这个命令，也给在场的所有人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 活下去。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "活下去。"
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 切城营救行动，是为了拯救生命。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "切城营救行动，是为了拯救生命。"
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 核心城潜入行动，也是为了拯救生命。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "核心城潜入行动，也是为了拯救生命。"
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 我们不说“为了某种事业我们能抛弃生命”，不。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "我们不说“为了某种事业我们能抛弃生命”，不。"
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 生命是宝贵的，是重要的，是属于各位自己的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "生命是宝贵的，是重要的，是属于各位自己的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 没有人，没有任何一个人，能够代我们浪费掉这次生命。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "没有人，没有任何一个人，能够代我们浪费掉这次生命。"
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] ......没有什么牺牲是必要的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "......没有什么牺牲是必要的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 这种说辞，一定是错的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "这种说辞，一定是错的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] Guard！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "Guard！"
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_059\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"罗德岛近卫干员？\"] ......我在听，阿米娅......罗德岛的领袖。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
        "content": "......我在听，阿米娅......罗德岛的领袖。"
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 对于整合运动也是一样的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "对于整合运动也是一样的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] ——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "——"
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 卡特斯！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "卡特斯！"
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 嗯。您说。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "嗯。您说。"
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\",name2=\"avg_npc_058\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 这里就交给我们吧。菲林，我们走！去给这只小兔子创造一片理想的战场。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "这里就交给我们吧。菲林，我们走！去给这只小兔子创造一片理想的战场。"
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 啊......阿米娅......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "啊......阿米娅......"
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 一定要做。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "一定要做。"
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_042\",name2=\"char_002_amiya_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042.png",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] .......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "......."
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[name=\"迷迭香\"] 我知道了。我一定会做到。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "迷迭香",
        "content": "我知道了。我一定会做到。"
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 嗯，好。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "嗯，好。"
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 阿米娅小队的成员们，跟我走！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "阿米娅小队的成员们，跟我走！"
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿米娅\"] 各位，我们活着再见面！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿米娅",
        "content": "各位，我们活着再见面！"
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_059\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[name=\"罗德岛近卫干员？\"] 再见......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
        "content": "再见......"
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_058\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[name=\"盾卫\"] 再见！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "盾卫",
        "content": "再见！"
