    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 重复一遍，陈警司。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "重复一遍，陈警司。"
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 我说的还不够清楚？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我说的还不够清楚？"
    },
    {
        "id": 165,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 166,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 很清楚。清楚到我怀疑自己听错了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "很清楚。清楚到我怀疑自己听错了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 167,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 陈警员，这不在你的职权范围之内。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "陈警员，这不在你的职权范围之内。"
    },
    {
        "id": 168,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 169,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 法律有国度之分，公理却没有。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "法律有国度之分，公理却没有。"
    },
    {
        "id": 170,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 171,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 维多利亚皇家近卫学院教了你什么？它有教你脚踏实地，不要好高骛远吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "维多利亚皇家近卫学院教了你什么？它有教你脚踏实地，不要好高骛远吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 172,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 173,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 我已经毕业了。我已经是一个为龙门服务的警员了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我已经毕业了。我已经是一个为龙门服务的警员了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 174,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 那我重复一遍，听好，“我的志愿是加入近卫局，之后，我会加入特别督察组”。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "那我重复一遍，听好，“我的志愿是加入近卫局，之后，我会加入特别督察组”。"
    },
    {
        "id": 175,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 我会捍卫这座城市，也会让它变得更干净。那种事不会再发生了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我会捍卫这座城市，也会让它变得更干净。那种事不会再发生了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 176,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 177,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 哪种事？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "哪种事？"
    },
    {
        "id": 178,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#4\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 179,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 你是真的忘性很大，还是故意装傻？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你是真的忘性很大，还是故意装傻？"
    },
    {
        "id": 180,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#4\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 181,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 注意你的言辞，陈警员。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "注意你的言辞，陈警员。"
    },
    {
        "id": 182,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 183,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 抱歉，长官。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "抱歉，长官。"
    },
    {
        "id": 184,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 报告魏长官，我所指的是距今十年前，龙门遭到外部势力侵入，市民遭到绑架并自此失踪的事件。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "报告魏长官，我所指的是距今十年前，龙门遭到外部势力侵入，市民遭到绑架并自此失踪的事件。"
    },
    {
        "id": 185,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 在我加入近卫局后，我依然会推动龙门对失踪人口的进一步调查和追索。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "在我加入近卫局后，我依然会推动龙门对失踪人口的进一步调查和追索。"
    },
    {
        "id": 186,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 187,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 陈......你不知道你在说什么。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "陈......你不知道你在说什么。"
    },
    {
        "id": 188,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 189,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 报告长官，我知道。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "报告长官，我知道。"
    },
    {
        "id": 190,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",name2=\"char_2005_weiyw_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5.png",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 191,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 我不会反对的。那就这样吧，当你做不下去以后，就告诉我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "我不会反对的。那就这样吧，当你做不下去以后，就告诉我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 192,
        "raw": "[name=\"魏彦吾\"] 陈警司，你想在近卫局干几年？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "魏彦吾",
        "content": "陈警司，你想在近卫局干几年？"
    },
